# Progress

After each milestone, update:

- `docs/PROGRESS.md` with status, checks and blockers
- `docs/IMPLEMENTATION_PLAN.md` if scope changed
- `docs/OWNER_DECISIONS.md` when a decision is still open
- `README.md` so it matches the running app

Statuses: Not started, In progress, Implemented, Verified, Blocked.

Verified means the relevant checks were run and passed. An untested feature stays Implemented or In progress.
